COMMENT ON INDEX no_such_ix IS 'idx comment';
ERROR 1064: You have an error in your SQL syntax; check the manual that corresponds to your MySQL server version for the right syntax to use near 'COMMENT ON INDEX no_such_ix IS 'idx comment'' at line 1
